PART 7 — THE UNFILTERED
==================================================

This is a separate anonymous community section.

Members can publish anonymous posts.

Anonymous posts publish immediately. They do not require administrator approval.

All contributions must appear anonymous:

- Posts.
- Comments.
- Replies.
- Likes and reactions.
- Administrator replies made inside this section.

