PART 17 — FIREBASE SECURITY
==================================================

This is one of the most important requirements.

Use real Firebase services, not mock implementations.

Set up:

1. Firebase Authentication.
2. Cloud Firestore.
3. Firestore Security Rules.
4. Required Firestore indexes where possible.
